OL,3,GNEWSAScot extradited from Dubai charged
OL,4,Awith organised crime offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been extradited to Scotland
OL,7,Ffrom the United Arab Emirates (UAE) to
OL,8,Fface organised crime charges.
OL,10,FAlan Thomson is accused of running a
OL,11,Fcross-border drug operation in Glasgow
OL,12,Fand England between March and June
OL,13,F2020.
OL,15,FThomson, 46, and co-accused Mohamed
OL,16,FEldirani, 55, are also alleged to have
OL,17,F"furthered serious and organised crime"
OL,18,Fbetween March and June 2020.
OL,20,FThe men made no plea during an initial
OL,21,Fappearance at Glasgow Sheriff Court and
OL,22,Fwere remanded in custody.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
